            </p>
            <p>Unified stretch suite combining three algorithms in a single interface.</p>
         </description>
      </package>
      <package fileName="EZDonutRepair_v1.0.3.zip" sha1="e89349f3cc638a637990818db37b16557354fb36" type="script" releaseDate="20261004">
         <title>EZ Donut Repair</title>
